WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.040 --> 00:02.239
This series was created for entertainment purposes.

3
00:02.240 --> 00:05.679
The characters, actions, locations, dialogue, languages, ceremonies,

4
00:05.680 --> 00:08.119
and artistic elements depicted in this series

5
00:08.120 --> 00:10.039
are fictional and based on imagination,

6
00:10.040 --> 00:13.919
incorporating the beauty of the region's diverse cultures,

7
00:13.920 --> 00:18.399
including those of Lanna, Myanmar, the Tai peoples, and China.

8
00:18.400 --> 00:20.559
It is not intended to disrespect any history,

9
00:20.560 --> 00:23.599
ethnic group, organization, profession, or group of individuals.

10
00:23.600 --> 00:25.960
Viewer discretion is advised.

11
00:37.040 --> 00:38.679
I am Na Boon.

12
00:38.680 --> 00:40.999
I lost my father when I was very young.

13
00:41.000 --> 00:44.986
And just recently, I lost my mother, too.

14
00:52.800 --> 00:54.565
I am Fongnuan.

15
00:54.566 --> 00:59.559
I've been alive my whole life, but never truly felt it.

16
00:59.560 --> 01:02.079
Okay. I'm coming. Hold on.

17
01:02.080 --> 01:04.573
Oops, I'm sorry. Really sorry.

18
01:08.280 --> 01:11.759
If this suffering comes from my karma,

19
01:11.760 --> 01:18.506
I ask for forgiveness for what I've done, in past lives and this one.

20
01:27.160 --> 01:28.759
I have no siblings.

21
01:28.760 --> 01:32.119
My best friend betrayed me.

22
01:32.120 --> 01:34.959
My lover stabbed me in the back.

23
01:34.960 --> 01:37.679
Is this the karma I've brought upon myself?

24
01:37.680 --> 01:44.919
Please grant me a new life, with the strength to do as I wish,

25
01:44.920 --> 01:51.141
to go wherever I desire, and to truly live,

26
01:51.142 --> 01:55.759
instead of spending my days just waiting to die.

27
01:55.760 --> 01:59.879
I don't know what I've done to deserve all this,

28
01:59.880 --> 02:02.297
but I'm begging for forgiveness,

29
02:02.298 --> 02:07.039
for whatever I did in my past lives or this one.

30
02:07.040 --> 02:10.679
Please, let fate be kind to me.

31
02:10.680 --> 02:13.613
Don't make me suffer any more than I already have.

32
06:02.000 --> 06:03.480
What the heck?

33
06:45.760 --> 06:47.320
How did you get in here?

34
06:48.280 --> 06:49.959
I mean, I...

35
06:49.960 --> 06:54.052
Did you sneak in to see our Water Spirit Ceremony?

36
06:54.053 --> 06:55.799
Hey!

37
06:55.800 --> 06:57.520
Don't come any closer!

38
07:00.200 --> 07:03.479
How dare you point a stick at the Prince?

39
07:03.480 --> 07:04.926
Prince?

40
07:06.440 --> 07:07.806
Fongnuan.

41
07:08.960 --> 07:10.719
How did you get in here, little sister?

42
07:10.720 --> 07:12.219
No, no, no!

43
07:12.220 --> 07:14.680
I don't have any siblings. I'm an only child.

44
07:16.120 --> 07:17.359
Soldiers!

45
07:17.360 --> 07:18.839
- Seize her! - Yes, Your Highness.

46
07:18.840 --> 07:20.160
Do not!

47
07:21.800 --> 07:23.839
She is with me.

48
07:23.840 --> 07:25.473
Let me handle her.

49
09:35.600 --> 09:36.973
Fongnuan.

50
09:38.160 --> 09:39.540
Fongnuan.

51
09:46.885 --> 09:48.333
Fongnuan.

52
09:50.224 --> 09:51.659
Fongnuan.

53
09:55.573 --> 09:57.313
How are you feeling?

54
09:58.960 --> 10:00.946
Do you still have a headache?

55
10:01.960 --> 10:04.919
You really are too mischievous for your own good.

56
10:04.920 --> 10:08.205
Why did you enter the Water Spirit Ceremony?

57
10:08.206 --> 10:09.813
Weren't you afraid?

58
10:13.233 --> 10:15.279
Fongnuan?

59
10:15.280 --> 10:18.273
Who is... Fongnuan?

60
10:19.000 --> 10:21.079
Do you think this

61
10:21.080 --> 10:24.266
will make me less angry that you snuck into the ceremony?

62
10:25.560 --> 10:30.100
Do you not know that women are forbidden from attending sacred ceremonies?

63
10:31.040 --> 10:35.976
I... I don't know how I came here.

64
10:35.977 --> 10:38.325
And that ceremony, I have no idea how I ended up there.

65
10:38.326 --> 10:41.999
I woke up and was suddenly just there.

66
10:42.000 --> 10:43.286
So...

67
10:44.400 --> 10:46.560
Sister, will you tell me...

68
10:49.320 --> 10:51.146
who I am?

69
10:59.880 --> 11:01.902
Your name is Fongnuan.

70
11:01.903 --> 11:04.359
My name is Maneethip.

71
11:04.360 --> 11:09.599
We're both from Wang Nam Lin. Your father was my father's younger brother.

72
11:09.600 --> 11:14.585
Your parents died when you were young, so you've been living with me ever since.

73
11:14.586 --> 11:18.119
We're like real sisters born to the same mother.

74
11:18.120 --> 11:21.073
Do you truly not remember, or are you just teasing me?

75
11:24.760 --> 11:26.006
Then...

76
11:26.904 --> 11:28.873
Where are we?

77
11:29.960 --> 11:31.559
Ullavee.

78
11:32.800 --> 11:35.313
We moved to Ullavee a long time ago.

79
11:36.720 --> 11:38.459
Ullavee?

80
11:39.440 --> 11:43.360
[Ullavee: The Forbidden Kingdom] Ullavee, an ancient forbidden kingdom.

81
11:43.600 --> 11:47.619
Its exact age has yet to be determined. It was only recently discovered.

82
11:48.880 --> 11:51.999
Ullavee was known as a tributary kingdom,

83
11:52.000 --> 11:59.212
caught between three major powers: Lanna, China, and Myanmar.

84
11:59.213 --> 12:03.159
Though small, Ullavee was a kingdom that no one wanted to go to war with,

85
12:03.160 --> 12:05.119
since it was a major center of trade.

86
12:05.120 --> 12:09.353
It was wealthy, with abundant gemstones and rich deposits of natural minerals.

87
12:11.086 --> 12:17.329
These are the ruins of Wiang Kaew, once the royal grounds of Ullavee's king.

88
12:17.330 --> 12:21.270
However, these accounts remain speculative,

89
12:21.271 --> 12:25.452
based on historical records, stories, and folklore.

90
12:25.453 --> 12:28.345
They haven't been conclusively proven.

91
12:28.346 --> 12:36.141
According to records from neighboring cities, Ullavee's last king was a very cruel man.

92
12:36.142 --> 12:39.640
He killed his own siblings to seize the throne.

93
12:42.196 --> 12:45.079
People were so afraid of him that they didn't dare talk about him.

94
12:45.080 --> 12:50.540
That's why we don't have many historical records about Ullavee.

95
12:51.282 --> 12:54.799
And the project will be called "The Forbidden, Hidden Kingdom."

96
12:54.800 --> 13:00.888
The client wants both the exhibition and the full audiovisual show.

97
13:00.889 --> 13:02.533
Let's work hard on this, guys.

98
13:10.340 --> 13:14.079
Here, Na Boon. The books about Ullavee.

99
13:16.007 --> 13:19.585
If you need more resources, I can recommend some libraries.

100
13:19.586 --> 13:23.320
But books about Ullavee are hard to come by.

101
13:31.168 --> 13:33.320
Ullavee.

102
13:34.720 --> 13:36.919
Ullavee?

103
13:36.920 --> 13:38.919
Have you gone bananas, Boon?

104
13:38.920 --> 13:43.099
Will you stop speaking so strangely? Tell me at once.

105
13:43.100 --> 13:45.980
Why did you enter the Water Spirit Ceremony?

106
13:48.996 --> 13:50.995
No.

107
13:50.996 --> 13:53.193
Something must have gone wrong.

108
13:54.457 --> 13:56.480
The medicine is ready, Your Highness.

109
14:00.666 --> 14:02.160
Eva?

110
14:25.925 --> 14:27.373
Come on in.

111
14:28.920 --> 14:30.879
So...

112
14:30.880 --> 14:35.426
Bew, are you sure Boon won't show up to surprise you for your birthday?

113
14:36.270 --> 14:37.720
Come on.

114
14:38.601 --> 14:42.013
Boon said she had a big project in Chiang Mai. She won't bother us.

115
14:45.680 --> 14:48.306
I'll go change, then we can celebrate.

116
14:57.040 --> 14:58.266
Boon...

117
15:09.533 --> 15:12.889
How could you do this to me? How could you?

118
15:12.890 --> 15:17.359
This is all your setup, right? You're just messing with me, aren't you, Eva?

119
15:17.360 --> 15:21.533
Who is Eva, my lady? I am Lha, my lady.

120
15:22.200 --> 15:24.159
Lha who?

121
15:24.160 --> 15:25.784
This isn't funny, Eva.

122
15:25.785 --> 15:27.279
Fongnuan.

123
15:27.280 --> 15:29.479
What are you talking about? I don't understand.

124
15:29.480 --> 15:30.979
Who is Eva?

125
15:30.980 --> 15:33.279
It's her! Eva!

126
15:33.280 --> 15:35.239
I am Lha,

127
15:35.240 --> 15:39.546
a servant to Princess Maneethip and you, Lady Fongnuan.

128
15:41.116 --> 15:42.666
Fongnuan.

129
15:44.297 --> 15:45.639
What are you guys playing at?

130
15:45.640 --> 15:46.999
- Lady Fongnuan! - Fongnuan!

131
15:47.000 --> 15:49.439
- Lady Fongnuan! - Fongnuan!

132
15:49.440 --> 15:50.960
Lady Fongnuan!

133
16:04.120 --> 16:05.920
Lady Fongnuan.

134
16:08.520 --> 16:10.033
Fongnuan.

135
16:12.480 --> 16:14.323
Lady Fongnuan.

136
16:22.080 --> 16:24.600
Sister, where is this place?

137
16:25.948 --> 16:27.479
Ullavee, my lady.

138
16:27.480 --> 16:29.060
Shit.

139
16:33.760 --> 16:36.994
Ullavee, an ancient forbidden kingdom.

140
16:36.995 --> 16:39.159
Its exact age has yet to be determined.

141
16:39.160 --> 16:40.746
It was only recently discovered.

142
16:42.538 --> 16:45.559
- Fongnuan! - Lady Fongnuan!

143
16:45.560 --> 16:47.159
These are the ruins of Wiang Kaew,

144
16:47.160 --> 16:50.119
once the royal grounds of Ullavee's king.

145
16:50.120 --> 16:53.286
- Lady Fongnuan! - Fongnuan!

146
16:59.560 --> 17:03.126
Lady Fongnuan! Lady Fongnuan!

147
17:20.040 --> 17:22.391
You said it was a forbidden kingdom.

148
17:22.392 --> 17:23.959
What made it forbidden?

149
17:23.960 --> 17:26.886
No one could enter or leave.

150
17:34.760 --> 17:36.940
- Lady Fongnuan! - My goodness!

151
17:36.941 --> 17:38.719
Lady Fongnuan!

152
17:38.720 --> 17:40.293
Lady Fongnuan.

153
17:42.480 --> 17:44.120
Lady Fongnuan.

154
19:33.520 --> 19:35.304
Fongnuan.

155
19:35.305 --> 19:37.622
How did you get in here, little sister?

156
19:37.623 --> 19:38.999
Where is this place?

157
19:39.000 --> 19:40.486
Ullavee.

158
19:41.520 --> 19:43.457
Ullavee?

159
19:43.458 --> 19:45.004
Ullavee, an ancient forbidden kingdom.

160
19:45.005 --> 19:47.456
Its exact age has yet to be determined.

161
19:47.457 --> 19:49.033
It was only recently discovered.

162
19:51.210 --> 19:53.012
Your name is Fongnuan.

163
19:53.013 --> 19:54.999
Fongnuan?

164
19:55.000 --> 19:56.679
Na Boon?

165
19:56.680 --> 19:58.839
Who is Eva, my lady?

166
19:58.840 --> 20:00.986
I am Lha, my lady.

167
20:00.987 --> 20:02.658
Lha?

168
20:02.659 --> 20:04.100
Eva?

169
20:07.040 --> 20:09.339
How are all these connected?

170
20:09.340 --> 20:11.353
Is this a parallel universe?

171
20:12.160 --> 20:14.313
But this is Ullavee.

172
20:16.312 --> 20:18.233
What am I doing here?

173
20:20.600 --> 20:22.599
I need to find a way back.

174
20:22.600 --> 20:25.346
A way back. A way back.

175
20:57.200 --> 20:58.646
Fongnuan!

176
21:00.940 --> 21:02.559
- God! - Fongnuan!

177
21:02.560 --> 21:04.533
- God! - Fongnuan!

178
21:29.640 --> 21:33.306
Are you all right? Are you hurt anywhere?

179
21:34.495 --> 21:38.616
I almost got hurt because of you. You suddenly barged in.

180
21:38.617 --> 21:44.079
You scared me. I was the one whose heart nearly stopped.

181
21:44.080 --> 21:47.109
Fongnuan, what's the matter with you?

182
21:47.110 --> 21:50.973
What were you thinking? Do you ever think about me?

183
21:51.720 --> 21:55.699
If anything happened to you, what would I do?

184
21:57.903 --> 21:59.393
I'm sorry.

185
22:02.690 --> 22:06.366
Don't you ever do that again.

186
22:07.450 --> 22:09.520
I have only you.

187
22:10.688 --> 22:12.533
Do not leave me.

188
22:36.960 --> 22:41.080
[Prince Mueang Fah]

189
22:52.000 --> 22:53.793
It's just me, Mueang Fah.

190
22:55.400 --> 22:56.321
[Prince Indraraja]

191
22:56.322 --> 22:59.093
Father already knew I would bring you before him.

192
22:59.790 --> 23:03.266
This is the first time in your life you've been granted an audience with Father.

193
23:03.267 --> 23:04.740
I'm happy for you.

194
23:06.920 --> 23:07.880
Father is very pleased

195
23:07.881 --> 23:10.720
with your suppression of the rebellion at the border.

196
23:11.393 --> 23:13.280
Should he ask,

197
23:13.865 --> 23:15.893
I trust you'll know what to say.

198
23:18.008 --> 23:20.673
"I merely followed the orders of the Crown Prince,"

199
23:22.633 --> 23:24.333
"Prince Indraraja."

200
23:25.726 --> 23:28.585
Very good. And your success was made possible

201
23:28.586 --> 23:34.553
with the aid of Crown Prince Pha Wiang of Merng Mang.

202
23:35.508 --> 23:36.900
I will not forget it.

203
23:38.400 --> 23:41.159
Pha Wiang, do you see now

204
23:41.160 --> 23:45.440
that my younger brother Mueang Fah is neither arrogant nor ambitious?

205
23:45.441 --> 23:48.253
He is honest and a man of his word.

206
23:50.640 --> 23:52.803
I, too, shall appear before the King.

207
23:53.539 --> 23:55.478
I wish to hear it with my own ears.

208
23:55.479 --> 23:59.559
If you honor our agreement, you will earn my trust.

209
23:59.560 --> 24:04.413
Your trust is worth less than my dignity.

210
24:05.453 --> 24:09.826
I will honor our agreement because I keep my word,

211
24:10.880 --> 24:13.199
not because I seek anyone's approval.

212
24:13.200 --> 24:15.040
Are you talking back to me?

213
24:16.960 --> 24:20.100
We're all on the same side here. No need to turn against each other.

214
24:25.503 --> 24:27.653
If you do as I say,

215
24:29.463 --> 24:31.989
you'll be allowed to reside in Ullavee.

216
24:31.990 --> 24:33.426
I promise.

217
24:50.000 --> 24:54.399
[Prince Kong Tai] [Prince Fah Haam]

218
24:54.400 --> 24:55.639
[Royal Consort Sukantha] [Prince Jom Harn]

219
24:55.640 --> 24:57.080
Jom Harn,

220
24:57.839 --> 25:00.860
did you know Mueang Fah was granted an audience with the King?

221
25:01.850 --> 25:03.839
Everyone in Wiang Kaew knows.

222
25:03.840 --> 25:05.852
How could I not?

223
25:05.853 --> 25:08.202
I'm glad Brother is here.

224
25:08.203 --> 25:09.792
It's been so long since I last saw him.

225
25:09.793 --> 25:11.219
I've missed him.

226
25:12.285 --> 25:16.639
You may miss him, but don't go near him, and never bring him to our residence.

227
25:16.640 --> 25:18.666
He will bring calamity upon us.

228
25:22.920 --> 25:24.119
[Royal Consort Chiang La-Or]

229
25:24.120 --> 25:26.499
- I bow before you, Royal Consort Sukantha. - I bow before you, Royal Consort Sukantha.

230
25:26.500 --> 25:29.526
- I bow before you, Royal Consort Chiang La-or. - I bow before you, Royal Consort Chiang La-or.

231
25:30.469 --> 25:33.760
Hongkham. You're here as well?

232
25:45.734 --> 25:48.212
Those of the outer court have royal duties to attend to.

233
25:48.213 --> 25:50.279
Such matters are no concern of the inner court.

234
25:50.280 --> 25:53.866
Government affairs are no place for women.

235
25:58.552 --> 26:01.079
Then why are you here, Royal Consort Sukantha?

236
26:01.080 --> 26:03.506
We are both women, are we not?

237
26:04.179 --> 26:07.335
The King permits me and your mother

238
26:07.336 --> 26:09.662
to attend an audience whenever matters of importance arise.

239
26:09.663 --> 26:11.759
Everyone knows that.

240
26:11.760 --> 26:13.479
Father has also allowed me

241
26:13.480 --> 26:16.479
[Princess Hongkham] to attend and broaden my knowledge.

242
26:16.480 --> 26:20.192
After all, I am his eldest daughter.

243
26:20.193 --> 26:22.999
Just because I am not a man

244
26:23.000 --> 26:24.199
does not mean

245
26:24.200 --> 26:27.119
[Prince Saen Thep] I cannot contribute to the affairs of state.

246
26:27.120 --> 26:30.359
You do so, Royal Consort Sukantha, as does my mother.

247
26:30.360 --> 26:34.860
You are both royal consorts. You stand as equals.

248
26:41.758 --> 26:43.919
Do not ever compare.

249
26:43.920 --> 26:46.033
Our bloodlines couldn't be more different.

250
26:46.760 --> 26:49.553
A lady of noble birth such as myself,

251
26:52.243 --> 26:54.253
and a mere merchant's daughter

252
26:56.494 --> 26:58.160
such as your mother,

253
27:00.092 --> 27:02.858
can never stand as equals,

254
27:02.859 --> 27:05.046
no matter how hard she fights to rise.

255
27:11.753 --> 27:13.320
Chiang La-or,

256
27:14.232 --> 27:16.686
teach your daughter better.

257
27:16.687 --> 27:19.363
Tell her that if she wishes to speak,

258
27:19.364 --> 27:22.009
she should speak with wisdom.

259
27:22.010 --> 27:25.063
Don't simply open her mouth and spout nonsense.

260
27:25.064 --> 27:28.060
Otherwise, everyone will learn...

261
27:29.969 --> 27:31.966
that your daughter is...

262
27:33.893 --> 27:35.213
an imbecile.

263
27:49.381 --> 27:52.513
- My apologies-- - Jom Harn! Come.

264
28:06.800 --> 28:11.293
Learn to hold your tongue, Hongkham. Stop asking for trouble.

265
28:27.360 --> 28:29.746
I thought a war was about to break out.

266
28:33.200 --> 28:36.013
Kong Tai, you should have stepped in to help Saen Thep.

267
28:38.786 --> 28:43.526
Fah Haam, I value my life. I have no wish to risk my neck.

268
28:44.640 --> 28:46.953
Did you not see the look in Royal Consort Sukantha's eyes?

269
28:46.954 --> 28:49.359
She could burn a man alive with it.

270
28:49.360 --> 28:52.073
If I had intervened, I'd have been burned to ashes.

271
28:53.440 --> 28:58.560
But if we are late, Father might burn us alive.

272
28:59.226 --> 29:01.193
You're right, Fah Haam. Let's go.

273
29:01.952 --> 29:04.255
Kong Tai!

274
29:04.256 --> 29:05.576
Goodness.

275
30:13.120 --> 30:16.826
- I bow before you, Your Majesty. - I bow before you, Your Majesty.

276
31:16.320 --> 31:20.199
[King Chai Saen Lue]

277
31:20.200 --> 31:22.279
[Seer Phrommaya]

278
31:22.280 --> 31:24.280
[Muen In]

279
31:27.155 --> 31:30.446
Now that you've returned, I see how much you've grown.

280
31:31.273 --> 31:35.886
Thank you for your great support for the Crown Prince.

281
31:36.800 --> 31:43.119
I would gladly lay down my life for Your Majesty and the Crown Prince.

282
31:43.120 --> 31:48.933
I shall do whatever the Crown Prince commands

283
31:49.806 --> 31:52.439
for the peace of Ullavee, Your Majesty.

284
31:57.220 --> 31:59.999
In suppressing the rebellion along the border,

285
32:00.000 --> 32:04.649
Ullavee was at a disadvantage, for the rebels had a far larger army.

286
32:04.650 --> 32:08.732
Yet Ullavee is guarded by towering mountain ranges,

287
32:08.733 --> 32:11.679
making it difficult for large armies to enter.

288
32:11.680 --> 32:14.219
Prince Indraraja recognized this advantage

289
32:14.220 --> 32:18.359
and ordered Mueang Fah and me to lead our troops from Merng Mang

290
32:18.360 --> 32:20.272
to reinforce the army and secure our victory.

291
32:20.273 --> 32:23.306
Prince Indraraja is truly astute.

292
32:24.844 --> 32:27.199
The enemy forces were but untrained peasants.

293
32:27.200 --> 32:32.630
Mueang Fah and Pha Wiang, acting under my command,

294
32:32.631 --> 32:34.540
led the troops to crush them

295
32:36.104 --> 32:39.046
and claim victory for you, Your Majesty.

296
32:39.736 --> 32:41.448
Your Majesty,

297
32:41.449 --> 32:44.219
should another rebellion arise,

298
32:44.220 --> 32:47.013
please let Jom Harn lead the army to quell it.

299
32:49.507 --> 32:53.812
I would argue that Saen Thep is the better choice.

300
32:53.813 --> 32:57.019
As the Third-in-Line,

301
32:57.020 --> 33:01.285
Saen Thep has fought side by side with the Crown Prince in numerous battles.

302
33:01.286 --> 33:04.199
This is a matter of life and death for the realm,

303
33:04.200 --> 33:06.960
not an occasion for practice.

304
33:08.030 --> 33:10.920
I agree with Royal Consort Chiang La-or.

305
33:11.740 --> 33:13.540
Jom Harn is still young.

306
33:14.984 --> 33:16.592
Which is a fair point, is it not?

307
33:16.593 --> 33:18.660
Jom Harn is young and strong.

308
33:18.661 --> 33:21.532
He is both a strategist and a warrior in his own right.

309
33:21.533 --> 33:26.960
We need not send two men to secure such a meager victory for His Majesty.

310
33:28.125 --> 33:31.865
Military command requires more than youth,

311
33:31.866 --> 33:36.662
strength, or knowledge of warfare.

312
33:36.663 --> 33:38.972
It requires knowing how to use men wisely

313
33:38.973 --> 33:41.340
and how to read the enemy.

314
33:42.243 --> 33:44.406
Indraraja doesn't fight himself.

315
33:44.407 --> 33:46.286
He simply makes plans...

316
33:48.760 --> 33:51.719
and orders someone else to fight for him.

317
33:52.754 --> 33:55.721
Winning through wisdom

318
33:55.722 --> 33:59.759
is more worthy of praise than anything else.

319
34:01.173 --> 34:08.140
As things stand, no one can protect Ullavee better than Indraraja.

320
34:12.680 --> 34:16.132
Indraraja, hear my command.

321
34:16.133 --> 34:20.043
Send troops to patrol the borders

322
34:20.044 --> 34:24.960
and ensure no further rebellions arise to threaten Ullavee.

323
34:24.961 --> 34:27.793
I shall see to it, Your Majesty.

324
34:45.103 --> 34:47.672
Indraraja wanted to assert his dominance.

325
34:47.673 --> 34:52.552
That's why he brought Mueang Fah and Pha Wiang before Father, in front of us all.

326
34:52.553 --> 34:55.091
You're overthinking it.

327
34:55.092 --> 34:59.306
He brought them because they helped him with his affairs.

328
35:00.363 --> 35:02.278
You're far too optimistic.

329
35:02.279 --> 35:05.791
Everyone knows Indraraja never fights in battle

330
35:05.792 --> 35:07.119
or even raises a sword,

331
35:07.120 --> 35:09.153
yet he gets praised left and right.

332
35:10.068 --> 35:13.800
It's Mueang Fah who wades through blood on the battlefield.

333
35:15.133 --> 35:19.249
And yet Father favors Indraraja in everything.

334
35:19.250 --> 35:21.006
He only has eyes for him.

335
35:22.503 --> 35:24.653
You keep fretting over the same matter.

336
35:25.226 --> 35:27.102
Aren't you tired of it?

337
35:27.103 --> 35:29.083
I am.

338
35:29.084 --> 35:34.426
But I still believe you're better suited to devising military strategies.

339
35:35.537 --> 35:37.765
You're the most capable among us.

340
35:37.766 --> 35:39.626
No one else comes close.

341
35:41.293 --> 35:43.239
You're the only one who thinks so.

342
35:43.240 --> 35:45.900
Plenty of people agree with me.

343
35:46.920 --> 35:49.659
You need to make something of yourself now.

344
35:49.660 --> 35:52.619
Once you've gone through the bedding ceremony,

345
35:52.620 --> 35:54.606
you may never want to go to war again.

346
36:12.129 --> 36:15.244
Oh, whatever became of that madwoman who interrupted our ceremony,

347
36:15.245 --> 36:18.032
Maneethip's sister?

348
36:18.033 --> 36:20.295
Has she regained her senses yet?

349
36:20.296 --> 36:23.019
She doesn't seem trustworthy.

350
36:23.020 --> 36:26.146
I hope she doesn't find another chance to sneak into the sacred spring.

351
37:07.100 --> 37:09.176
Please sit.

352
37:09.177 --> 37:10.786
Sit down.

353
37:16.938 --> 37:19.245
You mustn't sit like this.

354
37:19.246 --> 37:21.168
It's just wrong, my lady.

355
37:21.169 --> 37:23.719
Wrong... How?

356
37:23.720 --> 37:31.140
It's improper etiquette. It's considered sinful, vile, and inauspicious.

357
37:33.929 --> 37:35.906
What could be worse than that?

358
37:41.685 --> 37:46.593
Fongnuan, you seem much healthier and stronger than before.

359
37:47.565 --> 37:51.439
So... was I really that weak before?

360
37:51.440 --> 37:52.746
What?

361
37:54.029 --> 37:55.786
Say, "Your Highness," my lady.

362
37:56.660 --> 37:59.526
You must address princes as "Your Highness."

363
38:01.196 --> 38:03.178
"Your Highness," it is.

364
38:03.179 --> 38:07.707
Ever since she returned from the ceremony, she's been acting this way.

365
38:07.708 --> 38:09.839
She speaks strangely.

366
38:09.840 --> 38:11.798
She behaves strangely.

367
38:11.799 --> 38:14.506
It's as though her soul has left her body.

368
38:15.154 --> 38:18.637
I'd like to hold a soul recalling ceremony for her.

369
38:18.638 --> 38:21.023
Let's wait a few days.

370
38:21.024 --> 38:25.529
If she doesn't improve, I'll consult "Ma Khee".

371
38:25.530 --> 38:27.219
Ma Khee?

372
38:27.897 --> 38:29.950
Ma Khee is a woman

373
38:29.951 --> 38:34.284
who serves as a mediator between the human and spirit worlds.

374
38:34.285 --> 38:40.662
When something troubles us, when we fall ill, or when we lose something,

375
38:40.663 --> 38:44.159
we can seek the spirits' guidance through a Ma Khee.

376
38:44.160 --> 38:45.920
Like a medium, right?

377
38:47.373 --> 38:49.246
- Medium? - Medium?

378
38:53.711 --> 38:56.486
Never mind... Your Highness.

379
38:58.080 --> 38:59.933
So...

380
39:00.690 --> 39:03.406
why are you here, Your Highness?

381
39:05.322 --> 39:08.239
Prince Saen Thep is worried about you.

382
39:08.240 --> 39:13.778
If he hadn't intervened when you sneaked into the Water Spirit Ceremony,

383
39:13.779 --> 39:16.119
you would've been punished.

384
39:16.120 --> 39:17.726
Do you realize that?

385
39:21.243 --> 39:24.026
But I cannot protect you every time.

386
39:25.340 --> 39:29.719
Therefore, I forbid you from entering that place again.

387
39:29.720 --> 39:31.929
It's a restricted area.

388
39:31.930 --> 39:39.007
Only the King, the princes, and male members of the royal family may enter.

389
39:39.008 --> 39:41.013
The place for ceremonies?

390
39:42.790 --> 39:45.219
Promise him, Fongnuan.

391
39:48.383 --> 39:49.826
Fongnuan.

392
39:50.710 --> 39:54.699
Promise him you won't trespass there again.

393
39:57.106 --> 39:58.380
Sure.

394
39:59.026 --> 40:00.559
I won't go, Your Highness.

395
42:03.800 --> 42:04.839
Here.

396
42:15.850 --> 42:17.820
There is no place...

397
42:18.593 --> 42:21.185
more beautiful than Ullavee.

398
42:21.186 --> 42:25.075
I know you helped Indraraja with his affairs

399
42:25.076 --> 42:27.064
because you wanted to come home.

400
42:27.065 --> 42:29.353
You wanted to return to Ullavee.

401
42:31.383 --> 42:34.274
You seem to be the only one who understands.

402
42:34.275 --> 42:38.742
If you mean Mother wouldn't understand,

403
42:38.743 --> 42:41.269
then I'll speak to her myself.

404
42:41.270 --> 42:44.053
I'll ask her to let you live with us in our residence.

405
42:45.250 --> 42:47.853
Then you won't have to live in a temple like this.

406
42:52.045 --> 42:54.379
You speak as though you don't know Mother.

407
42:54.380 --> 42:56.248
I do.

408
42:56.249 --> 43:00.639
But I don't understand why she has to despise you.

409
43:00.640 --> 43:03.392
Just because you were born in the hour of the plunderer?

410
43:03.393 --> 43:05.948
I've never believed in that.

411
43:05.949 --> 43:08.965
And then there's what she told Father

412
43:08.966 --> 43:11.259
about giving me a mission to prove myself.

413
43:11.866 --> 43:14.158
I have no desire to become Crown Prince

414
43:14.159 --> 43:17.533
or inherit the throne in Indraraja's stead.

415
43:19.059 --> 43:23.386
I only wish to fight on the battlefield to protect Ullavee.

416
43:24.016 --> 43:25.586
You know well...

417
43:26.597 --> 43:31.887
that we can't always do or be as we wish.

418
43:31.888 --> 43:33.989
But that can change.

419
43:33.990 --> 43:38.285
If you distinguish yourself and earn Father's favor,

420
43:38.286 --> 43:43.720
perhaps he'll stop caring about the fate foretold by the stars at your birth.

421
43:46.080 --> 43:50.993
I'd... much rather see you become Crown Prince.

422
43:56.160 --> 43:58.473
I don't wish to become anything.

423
43:59.072 --> 44:04.520
Being your older brother... is enough to make me happy.

424
44:18.792 --> 44:20.586
Well then, next time,

425
44:22.020 --> 44:24.073
will you pull your punches a bit?

426
44:35.400 --> 44:36.446
Here.

427
44:48.679 --> 44:50.599
Indraraja had the audacity

428
44:50.600 --> 44:54.146
to bring Mueang Fah and Pha Wiang before the King.

429
44:55.027 --> 44:57.506
One is the outcast son.

430
44:58.259 --> 45:00.849
The other is the son of a ruler from another city.

431
45:00.850 --> 45:04.595
What was he thinking? How improper of him.

432
45:04.596 --> 45:10.627
Indraraja and Pha Wiang may live in different cities, but they're cousins.

433
45:10.628 --> 45:13.531
There's nothing unusual about helping each other with matters of state.

434
45:13.532 --> 45:17.059
But I don't trust them. Leave us.

435
45:24.120 --> 45:26.525
Merng Mang is a border city.

436
45:26.526 --> 45:28.752
There's no guarantee it will remain loyal to us.

437
45:28.753 --> 45:32.653
By doing this, it's as though Indraraja is inviting the enemy in.

438
45:33.317 --> 45:35.585
What exactly is troubling you, Mother?

439
45:35.586 --> 45:40.377
Pha Wiang is truly clever and cunning.

440
45:40.378 --> 45:43.236
Indraraja is no better a man.

441
45:43.237 --> 45:45.773
Word among the nobles is that...

442
45:46.370 --> 45:49.735
they're extorting taxes from caravan merchants.

443
45:49.736 --> 45:51.880
And then there's Mueang Fah.

444
45:52.529 --> 45:55.206
He was sent to Merng Mang at a young age.

445
45:56.103 --> 45:58.809
Now he's back in Ullavee.

446
45:58.810 --> 46:00.593
I find this peculiar.

447
46:03.020 --> 46:08.153
Do you know if those three are plotting a rebellion?

448
46:09.198 --> 46:12.145
That's a serious matter. How would I know anything about that?

449
46:12.146 --> 46:15.399
You know everything. How could you not know about this?

450
46:17.339 --> 46:20.399
Look into it. Find out what Indraraja is plotting.

451
46:20.400 --> 46:24.319
How am I supposed to look into it? Indraraja is extremely cautious.

452
46:24.320 --> 46:26.213
I can't get close to him.

453
46:53.743 --> 46:58.146
With enemies all around me, I must be extra cautious.

454
47:02.050 --> 47:06.266
I know many people want me dead.

455
47:11.639 --> 47:13.146
What about you?

456
47:14.195 --> 47:16.326
Are you one of them?

457
47:16.916 --> 47:19.223
I don't want you dead.

458
47:19.224 --> 47:23.469
I want you to become King.

459
47:30.036 --> 47:36.550
Why did you bring Mueang Fah back to Ullavee to assist you?

460
47:36.551 --> 47:38.879
Aren't you afraid he might betray you,

461
47:38.880 --> 47:43.833
side with his mother and his younger brother, Jom Harn,

462
47:44.724 --> 47:47.686
and overthrow you as Crown Prince?

463
47:49.470 --> 47:52.200
Mueang Fah would never betray me.

464
47:52.836 --> 47:55.093
I know his weakness well.

465
47:57.506 --> 47:59.040
What about you?

466
48:00.488 --> 48:03.833
Don't you wish to support Saen Thep as my rival?

467
48:07.937 --> 48:13.826
If Saen Thep becomes King, I shall simply be the King's sister.

468
48:19.005 --> 48:21.553
But if you become King,

469
48:26.247 --> 48:30.786
I shall be Queen, just as we agreed.

470
48:35.607 --> 48:37.560
Aren't you clever?

471
48:40.625 --> 48:42.812
We're in the same boat now,

472
48:42.813 --> 48:45.079
so we must row together to reach our destination.

473
48:48.182 --> 48:52.139
If Royal Consort Chiang La-or and Saen Thep conspire to overthrow me--

474
48:52.140 --> 48:54.000
I won't let that happen!

475
49:12.660 --> 49:14.753
Won't you stay with me tonight?

476
49:15.753 --> 49:17.846
You can leave before dawn.

477
49:18.907 --> 49:20.726
No one will see you.

478
49:23.506 --> 49:26.562
Once you become King,

479
49:26.563 --> 49:33.506
I'll pamper you openly, day...

480
49:37.480 --> 49:38.920
and night.

481
49:47.720 --> 49:51.453
You're teasing me... with every kiss.

482
49:58.286 --> 50:00.273
I mean every word.

483
50:48.896 --> 50:50.706
Now that you're back,

484
50:51.443 --> 50:54.966
I suppose you won't have to rush back to Merng Mang, Prince Mueang Fah.

485
51:05.241 --> 51:07.853
Whether I stay or leave,

486
51:07.854 --> 51:10.160
do I get to decide for myself?

487
51:11.106 --> 51:13.326
You can decide everything, Your Highness.

488
51:14.760 --> 51:19.980
It all depends on whether you choose to act.

489
51:30.797 --> 51:32.886
Since the day I was born,

490
51:34.506 --> 51:37.186
I've never been able to decide anything for myself.

491
51:38.656 --> 51:43.740
The stars have dictated my fate

492
51:45.106 --> 51:47.873
since the day I came into this world.

493
51:51.104 --> 51:52.760
You're a seer.

494
51:53.433 --> 51:56.980
You live by fate. You should know that.

495
52:31.682 --> 52:34.006
My fate...

496
52:36.650 --> 52:38.659
is to be an outcast son.

497
52:49.481 --> 52:51.273
You've just returned from the battlefield.

498
52:52.228 --> 52:55.740
Have you bathed in the sacred spring yet?

499
52:56.947 --> 53:02.766
Will bathing in the sacred spring make me a beloved son?

500
53:04.566 --> 53:07.352
No matter how sacred the water is,

501
53:07.353 --> 53:12.106
it cannot wash away my ill fate.

502
53:12.107 --> 53:14.013
Still, you should go.

503
53:14.719 --> 53:19.353
To pay your respects and tell the spirits you've returned to your homeland,

504
53:19.937 --> 53:23.699
so they can protect you.

505
53:23.700 --> 53:28.602
Cleanse yourself of the enemy's blood,

506
53:28.603 --> 53:32.340
lest evil spirits follow you.

507
53:39.287 --> 53:42.506
The stars may dictate your fate,

508
53:43.806 --> 53:47.533
but your own actions...

509
53:48.570 --> 53:52.353
can shape your life as well, Your Highness.

510
54:27.706 --> 54:31.159
I forbid you from entering that place again.

511
54:31.160 --> 54:33.319
It's a restricted area.

512
54:33.320 --> 54:40.432
Only the King, the princes, and male members of the royal family may enter.

513
54:40.433 --> 54:42.353
The place for ceremonies?

514
54:44.680 --> 54:48.733
I must go back the way I came.

515
55:29.686 --> 55:31.339
Who are you?

516
55:37.760 --> 55:39.080
I...

517
55:41.553 --> 55:44.825
I... I don't know either.

518
55:44.826 --> 55:48.380
Do you not know this is a restricted area?

519
55:49.474 --> 55:54.433
Anyone caught sneaking in here must die.

520
56:02.020 --> 56:03.919
Well, you caught me.

521
56:06.245 --> 56:08.086
Then kill me.

522
56:10.491 --> 56:13.466
Go on. Kill me.

523
56:17.386 --> 56:19.253
Aren't you afraid to die?

524
56:20.513 --> 56:22.586
There's no point in being afraid.

525
56:25.127 --> 56:27.715
I don't know where I am.

526
56:27.716 --> 56:30.340
I don't know how I got here.

527
56:31.113 --> 56:34.547
I don't know how to get back.

528
56:34.548 --> 56:36.533
I just want to go home.

529
56:45.118 --> 56:47.480
This place isn't where I belong.

530
56:49.260 --> 56:51.373
I just want to go home!

531
56:52.846 --> 56:56.553
But there's no one waiting for me at home anymore.

532
57:03.093 --> 57:04.673
Kill me.

533
57:05.508 --> 57:07.340
Maybe it's better to die!

534
57:13.800 --> 57:16.846
Go on. Just kill me.

535
57:24.703 --> 57:26.673
There's no point in dying, either.

536
57:35.369 --> 57:37.513
I'll pretend I never saw you here...

537
57:38.933 --> 57:40.906
and give you your life back.

538
57:42.775 --> 57:45.073
You still have a life to live,

539
57:46.057 --> 57:48.300
so live it happily.

540
58:37.677 --> 58:39.159
You still have a life to live, [Next Episode]

541
58:39.160 --> 58:40.824
so live it happily.

542
58:40.825 --> 58:43.439
Being you isn't so bad, Fongnuan.

543
58:43.440 --> 58:45.759
- Isn't it pretty? - Not pretty. You look like a madwoman.

544
58:45.760 --> 58:46.721
You're the mad one, jerk!

545
58:46.722 --> 58:49.528
You're quite clever, junior.

546
58:49.529 --> 58:52.241
It's as though you and Maneethip have switched bodies.

547
58:52.242 --> 58:56.159
Maneethip has grown quiet, while you never fail to make me smile.

548
58:56.160 --> 59:00.559
Anyone wishing to trade in Ullavee must pay taxes to Crown Prince Indraraja.

549
59:00.560 --> 59:02.079
This is a grave matter, Mueang Fah.

550
59:02.080 --> 59:06.439
I saw Pha Wiang extorting protection money from caravan merchants from Siao.

551
59:06.440 --> 59:08.793
I'd like you to see this matter properly resolved.

552
59:08.794 --> 59:12.339
But if you have no part in this, you would do well to be cautious.
